{
  "abstract": "Transverse momentum distributions of \u03bb o , \u03bb o , and K o , produced in pp collisions at x = 0, have obtained at the CERN ISR. The K o yield is in agreement with published K + , K \u2212 results, obtained at this centre-of-mass energy (\u221a s \u224844 GeV). The results on \u03bb o and \u03bb o production obtained in this experiment are compared with results obtained at lower centre-of-mass energies.",
